OL,3,GNEWSAFunding boost for teenage         
OL,4,Aactivities and support                 
OL,6,FYoung people in Lincolnshire are set to
OL,7,Fbenefit from #650,000 for activities   
OL,8,Fand support, the council has said.     
OL,10,FLincolnshire County Council said the   
OL,11,FYouth Matters Local Authorities Grant  
OL,12,Ffrom the Department of Digital,        
OL,13,FCulture, Media and Sport (DCMS) will   
OL,14,Fcreate opportunities to build skills   
OL,15,Fand connections.                       
OL,17,FNatalie Oliver, Executive Councillor   
OL,18,Ffor Children's Services, said: "Across 
OL,19,FLincolnshire, there is a clear need for
OL,20,Fmore positive activities and           
OL,21,Fopportunities for teenagers."          
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
